OLA-SEM is a focused RoboTwin LAP training and inference release derived from
Motus: A Unified Latent Action World Model.

Upstream project: https://github.com/thu-ml/Motus

The retained Motus implementation and this derived release are distributed
under the Apache License 2.0 included in LICENSE. OLA-SEM keeps the Motus Python
model class names for checkpoint compatibility. The RoboTwin deployment
policy directory and policy name are uniwam.
